id: pm-context-2cx5
title: Track SDK initialization of whitespace-suffixed repositories
description: "Out-of-scope SDK follow-up discovered while testing GitHub #154. With the pinned SDK 2026.10.15, initializing directly in a Git repository whose directory ends in a space creates the tracker but omits .gitattributes; the real-Git fixture then fails to stage that file. SDK repository discovery trims roots. File-focused reads are repaired by pm-context-gyq1, including installed CLI compatibility, but SDK initialization belongs to the host. Reproduce with a disposable real Git repository and SDK init before pursuing a host-side correction; do not change the dependency pin in this fix."
